{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-23641" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify $4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)+4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡(2x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23641" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we factor the $4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)+4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡(2x) & =4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}⁡(2x))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}⁡(2x)) & =4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡(2x) \\\\  & =4{csc}^{4}⁡(2x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23641" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb32fad11d557e7c2c792be7cbc43ece81051f832d7a78aee78b068d4b08577b"} {"question" "q-23641" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23641" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4{csc}^{2}⁡x"] ["math" "4{csc}^{4}⁡(2x)"] ["math" "4{csc}^{4}⁡(2x)+1"] ["math" "{csc}^{3}⁡(2x)"] ["math" "{csc}^{3}⁡(2x)+1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23641" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4{csc}^{4}⁡(2x)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify ${csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta .$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{({cot}^{2}⁡\\theta )}^{2}-2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1)^{2}-2({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1) \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +1)-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta +2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }-\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }+\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }-1-\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }+2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb32fad11d557e7c2c792be7cbc43ece81051f832d7a78aee78b068d4b08577b"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2"] ["math" "-3"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2"] ["math" "3"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23642" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify ${sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we expand the parentheses using the distributive property. This gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x) & ={sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x-{sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}-\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}-1 \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡x-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, using the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta $, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x) & ={cot}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb32fad11d557e7c2c792be7cbc43ece81051f832d7a78aee78b068d4b08577b"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x"] ["math" "{cot}^{2}⁡x"] ["math" "{cot}^{2}⁡x-1"] ["math" "{cot}^{3}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-23896" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{cot}^{2}⁡x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb32fad11d557e7c2c792be7cbc43ece81051f832d7a78aee78b068d4b08577b"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-74574" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Simplify $\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta }.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the identity\n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta =1.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression and using the fact that $\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta }={cot}^{3}⁡\\theta ,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta } & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{3}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb32fad11d557e7c2c792be7cbc43ece81051f832d7a78aee78b068d4b08577b"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta -1"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75dfef613e59bf7f0ac3e72967c549cde1bf517e14782c61c49386c8fa3"} {"question" "q-120321" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta "] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978749/state.json" "file_sha256" "5563c75